	"Name": "Big Beautiful Bachelors and Bachelorettes",
	"Author": "deleted82483243",
	"Description": "[center][b][u]This Mod Requires Smapi and Content Patcher[/u][/b]\n<br />\n<br />A simple mod that switches the character sprites and portraits of the singles in Stardew Valley, giving all of them a variety of fat body types.\u00A0 \n<br />\n<br />(This mod was partially inspired by the Super Sized Bachelors mod by BitterBosc)\n<br />\n<br />Notes:\n<br />Maru's portraits are unchanged aside from Hospital portrait.\n<br />Elliot's Portrait is based on an older ConcernedApe portrait.\n<br />\n<br />Instructions:\n<br />\n<br />-Install [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2400]Smapi[/url]\uFEFF and[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1915] Content Patcher[/url]\uFEFF \n<br />-Save mod into mod folder\n<br />-Extract into mod folder\n<br />-You're all set :)[/center]",
